c2cd33-feb8-5850-af19-6e3631c29b25" :question/worked-solution "Using the results \n\n$$\n{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)=x,\\,{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w)=2w,\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}f & ={∇}_{w}(3{w}^{T}x-‖w{‖}^{2}+1) \\\\  & =3\\cdot {∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)-{∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}^{2})+{∇}_{w}(1) \\\\  & =3\\cdot {∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)-{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w)+{∇}_{w}(1) \\\\  & =3\\cdot x-2w+0 \\\\  & =3x-2w.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-d8c2cd33-feb8-5850-af19-6e3631c29b25" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-669218e9-dbb9-5cbc-b3fc-b7445d8b9e17" :answer-field/id #uuid "669218e9-dbb9-5cbc-b3fc-b7445d8b9e17"] ["answer-303bfee8-5463-56bb-9681-e3b9d4158949" :answer/id #uuid "303bfee8-5463-56bb-9681-e3b9d4158949"] ["answer-303bfee8-5463-56bb-9681-e3b9d4158949" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-303bfee8-5463-56bb-9681-e3b9d4158949" :answer/value "3x-2w"] ["answer-0a1d37be-3fa0-59b9-bd20-4310f8e5627e" :answer/id #uuid "0a1d37be-3fa0-59b9-bd20-4310f8e5627e"] ["answer-0a1d37be-3fa0-59b9-bd20-4310f8e5627e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0a1d37be-3fa0-59b9-bd20-4310f8e5627e" :answer/value "3x-2w+1"] ["answer-d3532fcf-148d-5c02-9530-dfe46187e43d" :answer/id #uuid "d3532fcf-148d-5c02-9530-dfe46187e43d"] ["answer-d3532fcf-148d-5c02-9530-dfe46187e43d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d3532fcf-148d-5c02-9530-dfe46187e43d" :answer/value "3x-2‖w‖"] ["answer-dd3e8051-4283-52b3-93e7-0409ffbc90da" :answer/id #uuid "dd3e8051-4283-52b3-93e7-0409ffbc90da"] ["answer-dd3e8051-4283-52b3-93e7-0409ffbc90da" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-dd3e8051-4283-52b3-93e7-0409ffbc90da" :answer/value "3x-w"] ["answer-588514db-1798-58bb-9d0c-b764080a8b2c" :answer/id #uuid "588514db-1798-58bb-9d0c-b764080a8b2c"] ["answer-588514db-1798-58bb-9d0c-b764080a8b2c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-588514db-1798-58bb-9d0c-b764080a8b2c" :answer/value "x-w"] ["answer-field-669218e9-dbb9-5cbc-b3fc-b7445d8b9e17" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-669218e9-dbb9-